"Gregory Szorc \u003cgps@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1469999 - Use yaml.safe_load() in taskgraph; r=dustin\n\nyaml.load() can evaluate arbitrary Python code via syntax such as\n`!!python/object/apply:os.system`. Seriously.\n\nLet's switch taskgraph to yaml.safe_load(), which is reasonable\nabout limiting magic.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1736", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/config.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/cron/__init__.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/cron/decision.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/generator.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/morph.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/util/docker.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/util/taskcluster.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/util/yaml.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "933faa5c605decdd1158340cd3dbeaf8ad394feb", "parents": ["3ec08b5745f07254b83c2cfc30081ad887bdc731"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1451601 Do not buffer output in TaskCluster job output r=gps\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 4XOcqSXGhHi", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/job/mozharness.py", "testing/mozharness/external_tools/tooltool.py", "testing/mozharness/mozharness/base/script.py", "testing/mozharness/mozharness/base/signing.py", "testing/mozharness/mozharness/mozilla/testing/talos.py", "testing/mozharness/scripts/android_emulator_unittest.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "39094b8f419277ecccfe080b81d2ccbea40e19b7", "parents": ["933faa5c605decdd1158340cd3dbeaf8ad394feb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1471103 - Add a few useful packages to the base Debian docker images. r=froydnj", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/debian-base/Dockerfile"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2aa7d7efbdd5fa5d39b7bafce86eec499751b3b2", "parents": ["39094b8f419277ecccfe080b81d2ccbea40e19b7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Thomas \u003cnthomas@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1355482 - documentation cleanups for release promotion, r=aki\n\nVarious fixes for the docs to make docs better and sphinx happier\n* remove unused targets which were duplicated in  balrog, partials\n* fix up malformed targets and links\n* convert docstrings to comments so sphinx ignores example response in utils/partials.py\n* section underlines should match titles\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: GSYqsocBC4I", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/balrog.rst", "taskcluster/docs/kinds.rst", "taskcluster/docs/partials.rst", "taskcluster/docs/release-promotion-action.rst", "taskcluster/docs/release-promotion.rst", "taskcluster/docs/signing.rst", "taskcluster/taskgraph/util/partners.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "10d71f634565dd3c563cd396656b1d1ecf9f06b8", "parents": ["2aa7d7efbdd5fa5d39b7bafce86eec499751b3b2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1469423 - add an option to let l10n-bumper trigger builds. r=mtabara\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: CYOHmQ4os8l", "files": ["testing/mozharness/scripts/l10n_bumper.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1e77d5d45fb4a0756a9515529536a40f1fadda11", "parents": ["10d71f634565dd3c563cd396656b1d1ecf9f06b8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Thomas \u003cnthomas@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1355482 - documentation for partner repacks, r=aki\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 5uRWpw2WJyE", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/partner-repacks.rst", "taskcluster/docs/release-promotion.rst"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6a513fe07dfaebf1efcf561f394d0e24b26b6ad9", "parents": ["1e77d5d45fb4a0756a9515529536a40f1fadda11"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Thomas \u003cnthomas@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1471767 - taskcluster documentation fixes, r=dustin\n\nAssorted fixes from trawling the sphinx logs - malformed formatting, broken references, leftovers from renaming action-task to action-callback and removing\nyaml-templates, docstring fixes to make sphinx happier, and typos.\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 6jUOljdLoE2", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/caches.rst", "taskcluster/docs/docker-images.rst", "taskcluster/docs/how-tos.rst", "taskcluster/docs/kinds.rst", "taskcluster/docs/loading.rst", "taskcluster/docs/mach.rst", "taskcluster/docs/optimization-schedules.rst", "taskcluster/docs/taskcluster-config.rst", "taskcluster/docs/taskgraph.rst", "taskcluster/docs/transforms.rst", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/job/__init__.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/upload_generated_sources.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/upload_symbols.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/util/schema.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "29881f03bb5eebecc6364941406d0c114d123a94", "parents": ["6a513fe07dfaebf1efcf561f394d0e24b26b6ad9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Aki Sasaki \u003casasaki@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "bug 1432364 - remove scriptworker requirement for docker images. r=nthomas", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/docker-images.rst"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2870a1a9df1bf840da42700d38e61b33aef3856e", "parents": ["29881f03bb5eebecc6364941406d0c114d123a94"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1472610 - Disable sccache idle shutdown. r=gps", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/build/android.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/task.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ee9465ce4a25b4fb295fb5f6a04433fa23e95612", "parents": ["2870a1a9df1bf840da42700d38e61b33aef3856e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lisa Guo \u003clguo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1443873 - update beetmover in-tree payload to include buildhub. r=mtabara a=release", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/beetmover.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/beetmover_repackage.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4ed1196a1fd57bfa0ddcefce106b6ecb89c702cb", "parents": ["ee9465ce4a25b4fb295fb5f6a04433fa23e95612"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rok Garbas \u003crok@garbas.si\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1471541 - switch to new tooltool url, r=jlund", "files": ["tools/lint/eslint/eslint-plugin-mozilla/update.sh", "tools/lint/eslint/update.sh"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b382032f99369549c98643b0c6e2fbc1df6ca6c7", "parents": ["4ed1196a1fd57bfa0ddcefce106b6ecb89c702cb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Simon Fraser \u003csfraser@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1473276 'which' is non-standard, use 'command -v' in partials r=mtabara\n\nThis will start to cause an error when a newer shellcheck is available in CI\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1940", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/scripts/mbsdiff_hook.sh"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b693be3980063fee524772e2901204b521d34c53", "parents": ["b382032f99369549c98643b0c6e2fbc1df6ca6c7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1473528 - Don't cause jobs to auto-retry when failing for desktop l10n. r=sfraser\n\nIn l10n repacks we run the repackage multiple times, once for each locale. If something low level fails (like compare-locales) we'll abort out and call _add_failure (from _map) which then will set the return code based on the type of failure.\n\nHowever it, by default, will increment the return code each time it is called in BaseScript, so to preserve expectations here we should disable that from desktop_l10n.py\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1971", "files": ["testing/mozharness/scripts/desktop_l10n.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "888b318119ae00f2c0f60b42ded1cc1db835f5e3", "parents": ["b693be3980063fee524772e2901204b521d34c53"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Thomas \u003cnthomas@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1469757 - partner repack rebuilds pass the partner names incorrectly, r=aki?\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: ELWlYsnwDlS", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/partner_repack.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d11194bb954ab542815ae764e0d9dbcc78de1c83", "parents": ["888b318119ae00f2c0f60b42ded1cc1db835f5e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1469436 - Make repackage-signing distinct from its l10n, so we can depend on it in l10n for windows. r=tomprince\n\nThis is needed to not have a circular kind dependency when we actually spell out all dependencies (in a following patch)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1695", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/beetmover_repackage.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "16c0f8b02b399169e2dae6e00ba8ae60cef819d1", "parents": ["d11194bb954ab542815ae764e0d9dbcc78de1c83"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1469436 - Create a multi_dep loader and assign a first consumer in l10n. r=tomprince r=aki\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1696", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/l10n/kind.yml", "taskcluster/ci/nightly-l10n/kind.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/loader/multi_dep.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/l10n.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "eaf9ac9e69476086bf6bbb57d1bd20c7809c6082", "parents": ["16c0f8b02b399169e2dae6e00ba8ae60cef819d1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ben Hearsum \u003cbhearsum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "bug 1477021: switch funsize-update-generator to a Pipfile. r=sfraser", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/Dockerfile", "taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/Pipfile", "taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/Pipfile.lock", "taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/requirements.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1141d88bd144c3794e673ffc0a451d8fcfe3549d", "parents": ["eaf9ac9e69476086bf6bbb57d1bd20c7809c6082"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ben Hearsum \u003cbhearsum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "bug 1477021: create a docker image that can update Pipfile.lock, and attach diffs to phabricator. r=sfraser", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/docker-image/kind.yml", "taskcluster/docker/pipfile-updates/Dockerfile", "taskcluster/docker/pipfile-updates/README.md", "taskcluster/docker/pipfile-updates/runme.sh", "taskcluster/docker/pipfile-updates/scripts/update_pipfiles.sh", "taskcluster/docker/pipfile-updates/setup.sh"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "863c9f000faaffb47e9386392e26cbdf3427e14f", "parents": ["1141d88bd144c3794e673ffc0a451d8fcfe3549d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ben Hearsum \u003cbhearsum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "bug 1477021: create pipfile-update task for funsize-update-generator. r=sfraser", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/config.yml", "taskcluster/ci/pipfile-update/kind.yml", "taskcluster/docs/kinds.rst", "taskcluster/taskgraph/target_tasks.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/pipfile_update.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "14632c6e5fa2a1b1459e92a6ee40d4cda3cef64c", "parents": ["863c9f000faaffb47e9386392e26cbdf3427e14f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ben Hearsum \u003cbhearsum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "bug 1477021: run funsize with 'pipenv run'. r=sfraser", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/runme.sh"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "079bd02d070bed59b05f3ce07b2ddc84662045a2", "parents": ["14632c6e5fa2a1b1459e92a6ee40d4cda3cef64c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator pipfile-update. r=bhearsum\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2511", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/Pipfile.lock"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5325f95b02bbe597e6c9b4e570883fae2f7809b9", "parents": ["079bd02d070bed59b05f3ce07b2ddc84662045a2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris AtLee \u003ccatlee@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1466537: Disable full crashsymbols by branch r=ted\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1558", "files": ["Makefile.in", "taskcluster/ci/build/linux.yml", "taskcluster/ci/build/macosx.yml", "taskcluster/ci/build/windows.yml", "taskcluster/docs/attributes.rst", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/build.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/upload_symbols.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3d2e0c8e418b5d010ef14551fe0f9c71b4d7811c", "parents": ["5325f95b02bbe597e6c9b4e570883fae2f7809b9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gregory Szorc \u003cgps@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1467359 - Implement fetch-url jobs using a transform; r=tomprince\n\nPreviously, the fetch kind was defined by a job \"using\" flavor.\n\nAn upcoming commit will need to derive new tasks from fetch job\ndefinitions. In order to do this, we require a transform. And\nthis transform would need access to the original data from the\njob description. But by the time the \"using\" transform runs, a\nlot of this data is thrown away. It would be possible to stuff\nthe meaningful metadata inside attributes on the created task.\nBut this would result in the fetch logic being fragmented across\nmultiple Python modules (a fetch-specific transform and a job/using-\nspecific transform). I think it is better to keep all that logic\nin a single Python module.\n\nThis commit converts the \"using: fetch-url\" job transform to a\ndedicated transform for the fetch kind.\n\nSince we're now using a dedicated transform, we no longer need\nto use the normal job schema for defining fetch jobs. So we\nrefactor the schema a little so it is simpler.\n\nI verified the taskgraph output is nearly identical to before by\ndiffing the JSON output of `mach taskgraph full`. Aside from the\nadditions of ['worker']['implementation'] and ['worker']['os']\nfields (which seem to be required by a schema somewhere), everything\nwas identical.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1574", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/fetch/kind.yml", "taskcluster/ci/fetch/toolchains.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/fetch.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/job/fetch.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0aa10e3652455b80aeec20ecec11cdba245345c5", "parents": ["3d2e0c8e418b5d010ef14551fe0f9c71b4d7811c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gregory Szorc \u003cgps@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1467359 - Derive Treeherder symbol names for fetch jobs; r=tomprince\n\nHaving to define them explicitly feels too redundant for my liking.\n\nI believe we didn't do this before because we were defining things\nin terms of \"using: fetch-url.\" Now that we are using a custom\ntransform, we can have nice things.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1575", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/config.yml", "taskcluster/ci/fetch/toolchains.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/fetch.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a02c3d2f6c0eb3719366a040f6427dfdb5c25e1a", "parents": ["0aa10e3652455b80aeec20ecec11cdba245345c5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ben Hearsum \u003cbhearsum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1477021 - Add taskcluster proxy to pipfile update, so arc secret can be accessed. r=jlorenzo\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2509", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/pipfile-update/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cd5df0ec57cb0589d49efc20f89aa45c6da1aa9a", "parents": ["a02c3d2f6c0eb3719366a040f6427dfdb5c25e1a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1453274 - Fix Update verify tests p=Callek r=rail", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/release-update-verify-config/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2ccd653fce858595442fd197f1c5940400abcefd", "parents": ["cd5df0ec57cb0589d49efc20f89aa45c6da1aa9a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1479506 Propogate group symbol into upload-symbols task r=Callek\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 6KC60mdPI6F", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/task.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/upload_symbols.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9e3cd05ea78611326682b4af73663cc70981aa6b", "parents": ["2ccd653fce858595442fd197f1c5940400abcefd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Geoff Lankow \u003cgeoff@darktrojan.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1480274 - Add \"fetches\" to test schema; r=gps", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/tests.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8d473949bb26fc320af5e87d6d4b6213b9e0eed8", "parents": ["9e3cd05ea78611326682b4af73663cc70981aa6b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Steve Fink \u003csfink@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1475446 - Use in-tree zlib for msan, r=jonco", "files": ["js/src/devtools/automation/variants/msan"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5054f8eee6805ff893297da09f5009e88147039d", "parents": ["8d473949bb26fc320af5e87d6d4b6213b9e0eed8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Connor Sheehan \u003csheehan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1480232 - vendor latest robustcheckout with Mercurial 4.7 compatibility; r=gps\n\nThis commit updates the in-tree copy of robustcheckout to match the\n4.7 compatible version in version-control-tools at revision\n9fafc76e6f1c633897553523db01ad40edce5816.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2674", "files": ["testing/mozharness/external_tools/robustcheckout.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e35956f098c1b1a3c5b0e67da812316ef8a70f8c", "parents": ["5054f8eee6805ff893297da09f5009e88147039d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Connor Sheehan \u003csheehan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1446453 - upgrade Mercurial clients to 4.7 in Debian based Docker images; r=gps\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2623", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/packages/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d0f7a9c0073d1ccb1613ed188d586bbe0bcf61c4", "parents": ["e35956f098c1b1a3c5b0e67da812316ef8a70f8c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Connor Sheehan \u003csheehan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1446453 - install Mercurial 4.7 in Non-Debian Linux Docker images; r=gps\n\nThis commit points the `install_mercurial.sh` script at the\nnewest Mercurial distributions uploaded to tooltool.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2626", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/recipes/install-mercurial.sh"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d4e0e944c78afa6e161d169a22c5373eef48f4fe", "parents": ["d0f7a9c0073d1ccb1613ed188d586bbe0bcf61c4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jacek Caban \u003cjacek@codeweavers.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1475543 - Build rust as 64-bit binary for mingw targets r=froydnj\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: HOIclifAZXg", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/toolchain/windows.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9c55f110becf9f78b118d82697b68831d51e345f", "parents": ["d4e0e944c78afa6e161d169a22c5373eef48f4fe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1479506: Fix permissions on `taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/task.py`; r=me DONTBUILD", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/task.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c0ece69d726dba5cef9c45eaa1b823c925094ef6", "parents": ["9c55f110becf9f78b118d82697b68831d51e345f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Aaron Klotz \u003caklotz@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1480911: Fix mozharness to handle unicode environment variables when run locally on Windows; r=aki", "files": ["testing/mozharness/mozharness/base/script.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e225198d98b3b76b3fa0d76e75f696670c1722ac", "parents": ["c0ece69d726dba5cef9c45eaa1b823c925094ef6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Johan Lorenzo \u003cjlorenzo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1481240 - Let mozharness/configs/merge_day/bump_esr.py bump esr60 (instead of esr52) r=tomprince\n\nLet mozharness/configs/merge_day/bump_esr.py bump esr60 (instead of esr52)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2787", "files": ["testing/mozharness/configs/merge_day/bump_esr.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8e60d0aeed51cab94e52b612d2171f4c0281d9c4", "parents": ["e225198d98b3b76b3fa0d76e75f696670c1722ac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1474469 - Make sure nightly-l10n failures are properly reported. r=tomprince\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2040", "files": ["testing/mozharness/mozharness/base/script.py", "testing/mozharness/mozharness/mozilla/automation.py", "testing/mozharness/scripts/desktop_l10n.py", "testing/mozharness/scripts/mobile_l10n.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "93bbc84881aec9abd21f8416812d74ab472def69", "parents": ["8e60d0aeed51cab94e52b612d2171f4c0281d9c4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1481018 - Add language packs to nightly beetmover. r=tomprince\n\nThis isn't the cleanest addition but it solves our immediate needs.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2755", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/beetmover_repackage.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "20fee15f4ff7f267de4654f6b5c334ef150edc61", "parents": ["93bbc84881aec9abd21f8416812d74ab472def69"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1481018 - While here Remove unused beetmover defines, that are only a source of confusion. r=tomprince\n\nThis beetmover transform is only relevant for Fennec and *-Source platforms at this time.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2754", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/beetmover.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5cf1bb05e750ccfe0dcdcf4f99202a0e08bfc074", "parents": ["20fee15f4ff7f267de4654f6b5c334ef150edc61"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1477706: [try-select] Let taskgraph know that it is being called from try-select; r=ahal\n\nCurrently, `mach try fuzzy` generates a taskgraph that is configured exactly\nlike the most recent push to mozilla-central. This isn't always desirabe, so\npass some configuration down, to allow the taskgraph to behave differently.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2729", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/parameters.rst", "taskcluster/taskgraph/parameters.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/test/test_parameters.py", "tools/tryselect/tasks.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "98b50e814b9b1f2fafb1de282ba6f0f7519227d5", "parents": ["5cf1bb05e750ccfe0dcdcf4f99202a0e08bfc074"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1477706: [test-verify] Move logic for finding locally changed files to a helper; r=ahal\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2731", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/files_changed.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a99c5ab03059d496768103d7812bf1c52f2abdd2", "parents": ["98b50e814b9b1f2fafb1de282ba6f0f7519227d5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1477706: Fix typo in test; r=me", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/test/test_parameters.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4db59867ab1a3220b980f3e683f225a69a6fa4c3", "parents": ["a99c5ab03059d496768103d7812bf1c52f2abdd2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Thomas \u003cnthomas@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1481619: Upload symbols for the main Android builds r=ted\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D2925", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/build/android.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/upload_symbols.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a044bd4c70f5644630d752e8d91a25b3b6fe5b57", "parents": ["4db59867ab1a3220b980f3e683f225a69a6fa4c3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug: Don't generate trailing whitespace in `l10n-changesets.json`; r=aki\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D1536", "files": ["testing/mozharness/scripts/l10n_bumper.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9bbadee291014ba23bbfb66eff03f6a2c2e03c73", "parents": ["a044bd4c70f5644630d752e8d91a25b3b6fe5b57"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug: [mozharness] Remove no-op code block in repackage code. r=Callek\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D3528", "files": ["testing/mozharness/scripts/repackage.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8d545fa6bb9c1dc5ceac6e6ca38ba9487bcdce46", "parents": ["9bbadee291014ba23bbfb66eff03f6a2c2e03c73"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Wood \u003cCallek@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1484573 - Fix errant use of yaml.load() when yaml.safe_load() would be better. r=tomprince\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D3746", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/decision.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d7de6c8242c697d7748073c97cd065589ffd16e6", "parents": ["8d545fa6bb9c1dc5ceac6e6ca38ba9487bcdce46"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1484882 - Disable sccache idle shutdown on Windows builds. r=gps\n\nBug 1472610 did this for Linux builds. It was overlooked that Windows\nbuilds needed the same.", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/task.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d9f0f2f7fe98fca594d0c280d812df70002628c5", "parents": ["d7de6c8242c697d7748073c97cd065589ffd16e6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ionut Goldan \u003cigoldan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1411304 - lowerIsBetter not true for sccache hit rate r=jmaher\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D3959", "files": ["testing/mozharness/mozharness/mozilla/building/buildbase.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8a07d9ed34d3856e17efa0dc395105c91017df26", "parents": ["d9f0f2f7fe98fca594d0c280d812df70002628c5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Greg Mierzwinski \u003cgmierz1@live.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1473048 - Prevent code coverage builds from running when using try option syntax. r=ahal\n\nThis patch completely disables *ccov, and *jsdcov builds and tests when scheduling them through try option syntax as these build variations use a lot of resources and are rarely needed to be scheduled. The only way to schedule code coverage from now on will be with the |mach try fuzzy| tool.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D3921", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/tests.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/try_option_syntax.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "07aa5059a687cfa418c14394e33b09c7513926f8", "parents": ["8a07d9ed34d3856e17efa0dc395105c91017df26"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Johan Lorenzo \u003cjlorenzo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1483521 - PushAPK shouldn't depend on single-locale android r=Callek\n\nPushAPK shouldn't depend on single-locale android\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D3512", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/push-apk/kind.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/push_apk.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0e019a588f262c1d5a4d5741094207e9980587c0", "parents": ["07aa5059a687cfa418c14394e33b09c7513926f8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1486995 - Use fetch task for binutils source for the binutils toolchain. r=dmajor\n\nWhile here, use nproc instead of hardcoding a -j value.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D4515", "files": ["build/unix/build-binutils/build-binutils.sh", "taskcluster/ci/toolchain/linux.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "87f1ac515be90f0bd6cf0b250c7a5330476ab912", "parents": ["0e019a588f262c1d5a4d5741094207e9980587c0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1478883: [release] Fix typo in treescript's `dontbuild` parameter.; r=Callek\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D4806", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/task.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "075eb21ec9a8e962ab6416517dbdad89659bfd5d", "parents": ["87f1ac515be90f0bd6cf0b250c7a5330476ab912"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Clary \u003cbclary@bclary.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1486899 - Do not use virtualenv_options.append('--always-copy') on Redhat derived distros, r=jlund,ahal.", "files": ["testing/mozharness/mozharness/base/python.py", "testing/mozharness/mozharness/base/script.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c9f5e1d2b9352687c5bd8e4c8aec196c735c7c6d", "parents": ["075eb21ec9a8e962ab641651